# s57b — the derived tag (option B): race carries the value and `as nord race Nord`
# names the equality mask over the live column — δ_Nord ∘ race, recomputed at each use.
# The case contract in one line: nord folds (a name), Nord never does (a race value).
# Twin registry 131-derived-tag-a.reg stores the same tag as written bits; the demo pins
# are identical across both — that equality is the claim. Delete the `as` line and the
# program's Nord has no referent: the demo fails at compile.
n 5
col race sym Nord Khajiit Nord Nord Orc
col gold nat 400 600 200 150 221
rel master 2 -1 -1 4 -1
as nord race Nord
ja 北 nord
ja 金 gold
